---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Quality Control & Cupping Laboratory | Demo Coffee Exporters Ltd."
  description="Explore our sensory lab model at Plot 45 Industrial Area Kampala. Licensed Q-Graders, SCA cupping protocols, digital moisture testing, and pre-shipment sample verification."
>
  <!-- Page Header with Background Image -->
  <div 
    class="relative text-white py-20 lg:py-28 border-b border-stone-800 bg-cover bg-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.78) 0%, rgba(18, 16, 15, 0.90) 100%), url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498804103079-a6351b050096?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2000&q=80');"
  >
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-600/40 text-[10px] text-amber-300 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">
          <span>SENSORY PROTOCOLS</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold font-serif tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Sensory Analysis and Physical Quality Assurance
        </h1>
        <p class="text-stone-200 text-sm sm:text-base mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Operating a dedicated cupping laboratory model staffed by licensed Q-Arabica and Q-Robusta graders. Every consignment is systematically assessed across intake, milling, and container stuffing phases.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Laboratory Specifications -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block">
            SENSORY METHODOLOGY
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
            The Three-Stage Cupping Verification Process
          </h2>
          <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Unlike trading houses that rely strictly on visual inspection, Demo Coffee Exporters demonstrates full SCA sensory evaluation standards. Samples are roasted on electric sample roasters, rested, and evaluated by at least two licensed cuppers.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
            <div class="border-l-2 border-coffee-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase">Stage 1: Field Intake Verification</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
                Parchment delivered from washing stations in Mbale, Kapchorwa, or Kasese is evaluated for moisture stability, fermentation purity, and baseline sensory attributes.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-2 border-coffee-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase">Stage 2: Post-Milling Batch Cupping</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
                Following optical color sorting, green coffee from each silo batch is tested for defect purity, acidity clarity, body, balance, and sweetness.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-l-2 border-coffee-500 pl-4 space-y-1">
              <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 uppercase">Stage 3: Pre-Shipment PSS Sign-off</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">
                A composite sample is drawn from loaded container bags. This representative sample is divided: one portion is dispatched via DHL to the buyer, and one retained in our library.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Metric Lab Box -->
        <div class="bg-stone-50 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border border-stone-200 space-y-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 border-b border-stone-200 pb-3">
            Physical Quality Specifications
          </h3>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1">
              <span class="text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-wider block text-[10px]">Moisture Maximum</span>
              <div class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">12.0%</div>
              <p class="text-stone-500 text-[11px]">Calibrated with digital capacitance meters.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1">
              <span class="text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-wider block text-[10px]">Water Activity</span>
              <div class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">&lt; 0.60 Aw</div>
              <p class="text-stone-500 text-[11px]">Prevents mold growth during ocean voyage.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1">
              <span class="text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-wider block text-[10px]">Screen Retention</span>
              <div class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">90% Minimum</div>
              <p class="text-stone-500 text-[11px]">Retained on designated slotted screens.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 space-y-1">
              <span class="text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-wider block text-[10px]">Primary Defects</span>
              <div class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">0 in Specialty</div>
              <p class="text-stone-500 text-[11px]">Zero full black or full sour beans allowed.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-coffee-50 border border-coffee-200 text-xs text-coffee-800 leading-relaxed">
            All sensory protocols follow Specialty Coffee Association standards, utilizing filtered water with mineral hardness between 125 and 175 ppm TDS.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pre-Shipment Sample Dispatch Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-[#FAF8F5] border-t border-stone-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-coffee-600 block mb-1">
          SAMPLE SERVICE
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-serif text-stone-900 tracking-tight">
          How to Request Green Coffee Cupping Samples
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 mt-2">
          We maintain stock of fresh green coffee samples for commercial roasters, green coffee brokers, and importers worldwide.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 text-center space-y-3 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-sm">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Select Desired Origins</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Browse our offerings and specify which grades you require: Bugisu AA, Bugisu A, Peaberry, Rwenzori Natural, or Screen 18 Robusta.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 text-center space-y-3 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-sm">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Lab Packaging & Data Sheet</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Our sensory laboratory seals 300g to 500g of green coffee in high-barrier foil pouches, enclosed with complete physical and sensory lab reports.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 text-center space-y-3 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-coffee-100 text-coffee-700 font-bold flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-sm">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-stone-900">Express Air Courier Dispatch</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
            Parcels are collected daily by DHL Express in Kampala and delivered to roasteries across Europe, North America, and Asia within 3 to 5 business days.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-12">
        <a
          href="/quote?interest=sample"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-[#A35326] to-[#BA5E2B] hover:from-[#8E431B] hover:to-[#A35326] transition-all shadow-lg"
        >
          Submit Sample Request
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
